WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:14.037
stole Mr.

2
00:00:14.077 --> 00:00:15.737
Wig's money," thought Roxy.

3
00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:18.779
"I need to get to his house right away!"

4
00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.520
Roxy's friends were coming back toward her.

5
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.381
They didn't look happy.

6
00:00:23.401 --> 00:00:27.862
"That guy didn't want any candy bars either," said Jack.

7
00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:30.283
"You know what?"

8
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:31.284
said Roxy.

9
00:00:32.624 --> 00:00:34.405
"I think we skipped some houses.

10
00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:36.246
I'll go back to them."

11
00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:39.127
Roxy ran off.

12
00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:41.548
Terrell scratched his head.

13
00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:44.289
"We didn't skip any houses."

14
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.770
Mara pointed to the sky.

15
00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.772
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

16
00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:55.434
A moment later Roxy arrived at Mr.

17
00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:56.015
Wig's house.

18
00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.956
Detective Smith was climbing into the safe.

19
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.481
Roxy smiled.

20
00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:06.084
"I doubt the robber is still in there, Detective."

21
00:01:10.387 --> 00:01:13.810
funny." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

22
00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.312
"I know the robber isn't in here.

23
00:01:16.432 --> 00:01:17.633
I'm looking for clues."

24
00:01:18.674 --> 00:01:20.175
Mr. Wig frowned at Roxy.

25
00:01:20.195 --> 00:01:23.378
"I can't believe you're making jokes!

26
00:01:24.559 --> 00:01:26.380
My money was stolen!"

27
00:01:26.401 --> 00:01:28.762
"Don't worry, Mr.

28
00:01:28.782 --> 00:01:30.324
Wig," said Detective Smith.

29
00:01:31.296 --> 00:01:32.136
He stood back up.

30
00:01:33.317 --> 00:01:35.378
"We'll find the thief and get your money back.

31
00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:38.379
Rocket Girl has lots of super powers."

32
00:01:38.399 --> 00:01:43.641
"Yes, I know about Rocket Girl's super powers," said Mr.

33
00:01:43.681 --> 00:01:45.782
Wig. He looked at Roxy.

34
00:01:45.802 --> 00:01:47.583
"You can fly, right?"

35
00:01:47.603 --> 00:01:49.744
"Yep!" said Roxy.

36
00:01:49.764 --> 00:01:52.645
"Well, so can I," said Mr.

37
00:01:52.685 --> 00:01:56.286
Wig. "Because I have my very own jet."

38
00:01:56.306 --> 00:02:00.128
"Big deal," said Roxy.

39
00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:03.410
"I can shoot lasers from my eyes.

40
00:02:04.451 --> 00:02:06.072
And I can see through walls."

41
00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.953
"Hmph!" Mr.

42
00:02:08.013 --> 00:02:09.134
Wig folded his arms.

43
00:02:09.154 --> 00:02:12.777
"I'm one of the richest people in Metro City."

44
00:02:13.658 --> 00:02:15.059
Roxy folded her arms.

45
00:02:16.079 --> 00:02:18.802
"I can lift a truck."

46
00:02:18.862 --> 00:02:19.742
Mr. Wig shrugged.

47
00:02:19.762 --> 00:02:22.845
"Just find my money, please."

48
00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:27.048
Roxy and Detective Smith went outside.

49
00:02:28.256 --> 00:02:31.058
"I do not like that man," said Roxy.

50
00:02:31.078 --> 00:02:35.201
"Let's just try to solve this case," said Detective Smith.

51
00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.604
"Mr. Wig said he heard a buzzing sound.

52
00:02:39.364 --> 00:02:41.586
And there were spider webs in his bedroom."

53
00:02:42.507 --> 00:02:43.627
Roxy looked thoughtful.

54
00:02:43.647 --> 00:02:46.710
"Maybe bugs robbed Mr.

55
00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.913
Wig." "Ha-ha," said Detective Smith, pretending to laugh again.

56
00:02:51.933 --> 00:02:55.216
"No, I'm serious," said Roxy.

57
00:02:56.456 --> 00:02:58.257
"Remember the villain Von Buzz?

58
00:02:59.177 --> 00:03:01.357
He trained bugs to steal things."

59
00:03:02.498 --> 00:03:03.838
Detective Smith shook his head.

60
00:03:03.858 --> 00:03:06.379
"It can't be Von Buzz.

61
00:03:06.479 --> 00:03:07.339
He's in jail."

62
00:03:07.359 --> 00:03:10.780
"He was in jail," said Roxy.

63
00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.901
"But he got out two weeks ago."

64
00:03:13.921 --> 00:03:16.002
"You're right!"

65
00:03:16.382 --> 00:03:17.302
said Detective Smith.

66
00:03:17.322 --> 00:03:19.363
"I forgot about that."

67
00:03:19.383 --> 00:03:23.904
"Maybe Von Buzz started robbing people again," said Roxy.

68
00:03:24.992 --> 00:03:27.033
Just then Detective Smith's phone rang.

69
00:03:27.053 --> 00:03:31.134
"Yes?" said the detective.

70
00:03:32.255 --> 00:03:33.995
"Really? We'll be right there!"

71
00:03:35.096 --> 00:03:35.956
He hung up the phone.

72
00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:38.577
"Someone just broke into Mrs.

73
00:03:38.737 --> 00:03:39.497
Bun's house.

74
00:03:40.297 --> 00:03:41.578
She lives on this street too."

75
00:03:42.578 --> 00:03:43.839
He turned back to Roxy.

76
00:03:44.659 --> 00:03:46.239
"Let's Rocket Girl?"
